<title>LEBANON: Lebanon's Solidere mixed on official bourse.</title>
<headline>Lebanon's Solidere mixed on official bourse.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solidere shares were mixed on Monday as A shares fell slightly to $113.625 from $113.875 and B shares rose to $116.75 from $116.375.</p>
<p>Turnover in Solidere shares on the Beirut Stock Exchange (BSE) was 8,017 shares compared with 11,180 shares on Friday and value was $914,336 from $1,275,247.625.</p>
<p>Also traded were 100 shares of piping maker Eternit at $1.625 from $1.5625 on Friday.</p>
<p>The LISPI stock index rose 0.58 percent to 82.45 and the BLOM stock index also rose 0.08 percent to 974.89.</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (9611) 353078 645456 602057</p>
